<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's LG-Caltex in $300 mln U.S. paper program.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's LG-Caltex in $300 mln U.S. paper program.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's LG-Caltex Oil Corp said on Wednesday it would sign a $300 million U.S. commercial paper program on Wednesday in New York.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the program has been rated P-2 by Moody's and A2 by Standard &amp; Poor's.</p>
</text>
